<title>USA: Sioux City hogs off $0.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux City hogs off $0.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX CITY 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said trade was slow.</p>
<p>Compared with Wednesday, barrows and gilts were $0.50 lower.</p>
<p>Top $53.00 per cwt.</p>
<p>    US 1-3   220-270 lbs     53.00</p>
<p>		 270-280 lbs     52.50-53.00</p>
<p>    US 2-3   280-300 lbs     50.50-52.00</p>
<p>    US 3-4   300-330 lbs     48.00-50.00</p>
<p>Sows - all weights steady/up $3.00. Top $53.75.</p>
<p>    US 1-3     300-400 lbs     43.00</p>
<p>		   400-450 lbs     45.00-47.00</p>
<p>		   450-500 lbs     47.00-49.00</p>
<p>		   500-550 lbs     52.00</p>
<p>		   550-700 lbs     53.00-53.75</p>
</text>
